The plate is about 355 px across, which I take to be a ~26 cm dinner plate. The food is two pizza slices stacked or folded, each about 12 cm long, with basil leaves on top. Together they look like about 1.5 slices of cheese pizza.

Each slice is thin, about 100 g, which puts the two at roughly 180–200 g. At about 2.7 kcal/g, that comes to about 500 kcal. The slices may be smaller than that, though. They cover only about 9×12 cm, so I'll settle on 160 g and about 420 kcal.

